    "name": "Mini Eco",
    "steam_appid": 3472410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mini Eco</i></strong> is a relaxing ecosystem simulation game where you shape a lively, ever-changing world. Nurture your environment, guide evolution, and protect your creations\u2014all at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Shape Your World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just an observer\u2014you\u2019re a creator.<br>Transform oceans into forests, deserts into jungles, and more. Each biome brings new creatures, challenges, and surprises. The world evolves based on your choices, so no two ecosystems are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3f Explore, Collect, and Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vibrant natural world full of secrets. As you explore, collect unique items that unlock powerful abilities or enhance the ones you already have. Click around\u2014or get creative\u2014and you might just uncover some truly rare treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddec Evolve Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures grow, change, and adapt over time. Their genes affect everything from size and color to speed and behavior. See something you like? Save the gene and use it to create your dream creature later on.<br>Stick around long enough and who knows\u2014you might even witness the birth of an entirely new species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Defend What You\u2019ve Built</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not all sunshine and butterflies\u2014hidden threats lurk in the wild. Use your magical powers to fight back against monsters that threaten your delicate ecosystem. Unlock powerful spells and keep your world safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Complete Quests &amp; Discover Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s always something new to do!<br>Take on world quests to earn rewards, gain new powers, and uncover hidden tips and lore along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mini Eco</i></strong> is a relaxing ecosystem simulation game where you shape a lively, ever-changing world. Nurture your environment, guide evolution, and protect your creations\u2014all at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Shape Your World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just an observer\u2014you\u2019re a creator.<br>Transform oceans into forests, deserts into jungles, and more. Each biome brings new creatures, challenges, and surprises. The world evolves based on your choices, so no two ecosystems are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3f Explore, Collect, and Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vibrant natural world full of secrets. As you explore, collect unique items that unlock powerful abilities or enhance the ones you already have. Click around\u2014or get creative\u2014and you might just uncover some truly rare treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddec Evolve Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures grow, change, and adapt over time. Their genes affect everything from size and color to speed and behavior. See something you like? Save the gene and use it to create your dream creature later on.<br>Stick around long enough and who knows\u2014you might even witness the birth of an entirely new species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Defend What You\u2019ve Built</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not all sunshine and butterflies\u2014hidden threats lurk in the wild. Use your magical powers to fight back against monsters that threaten your delicate ecosystem. Unlock powerful spells and keep your world safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Complete Quests &amp; Discover Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s always something new to do!<br>Take on world quests to earn rewards, gain new powers, and uncover hidden tips and lore along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "MiniEco is a cozy top-down nature sim that combines laid-back idle gameplay, hands-on ecosystem management, and a hint of god-like power. Nurture or disrupt evolving species, shape their habitats, and watch as thousands of organisms adapt\u2014or clash\u2014in real time.",
